      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually we don\u0027t have a string to provide here, since `WGPUDevice DawnTestBase::CreateDeviceImpl` (and further `WGPUDevice dawn::native::Adapter::CreateDevice`) only return a pointer but no message string. \n\nIn the [previous patchset](https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/273074/6) I tried to hook the logging callback of instance to get such messages provided through `InstanceBase::ConsumedError`, but it might not be worthy to do that since we don\u0027t need to parse that message now.",
