      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T18:46:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should move this to be conditional inside the callback below, i.e something like:\n\n```\nadapter.RequestDevice(\n  \u0026deviceDesc,\n  wgpu::CallbackMode::AllowSpontaneous,\n  [\u0026apiDevice](wgpu::RequestDeviceStatus status,\n               wgpu::Device result,\n               wgpu::StringView) { \n                 if (status \u003d\u003d wgpu::RequestDeviceStatus::Succcess) {\n                   apiDevice \u003d std::move(result);\n                 } else {\n                   EXPECT_CALL(\n                     mDeviceLostCallback,\n                     Call(_, wgpu::DeviceLostReason::FailedCreation, _))\n                   .Times(AtMost(1))\n                   .RetiresOnSaturation();\n                 }\n               }\n);\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1292,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 1296,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "4eeffb214f5d5e5b9887caacf9e25ac5db43e53b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
